msg "All isochrons to a file (AUTO File > Write pts), into the data browser, coloured by phase"
autokeys f w
ans M3_HH_isochrons.dat
browser open
browsekeys l
ans M3_HH_isochrons.dat
browsekeys p
ans v
ans t
browsekeys p
ans dl
ans (tord(flr((w0+1)/2))-1)/20
browser close
msg "The isochrons in the phase plane, coloured by phase (0 blue ... 0.95 red), on Gamma and the nullclines"
autokeys esc
keys u c a
ans dl
ans c
ans 0
ans 0.95
keys esc
set lt=-2
keys v 2
ans X-axis=v|Y-axis=w|Xmin=-100|Ymin=0.3|Xmax=55|Ymax=0.8|Xlabel=V|Ylabel=n
keys g x
ans |||0|0
keys r
keys n n
msg "Done: 20 isochrons of the reduced HH neuron, phases 0 ... 0.95, one loop over the tables. The AUTO window shows the same curves, n(0) against V(0)."
